<tab>Archmages are great magicians who despise brute physical strength. The one who already
he managed to become famous in military affairs and get a serious title, maybe
Forget about the Archmage Guild. Guild members do not have military skills,
which is compensated by the excellent knowledge of elemental magic. However, this does not mean that
in battle, the archmage will not be able to stand up for himself - the secret knowledge of the guild gives a serious
protection against physical attacks.<br>
